webhook_schema:
Events: recommendation.lifecycle.created, recommendation.lifecycle.validated, recommendation.lifecycle.applied, recommendation.lifecycle.rolled_back
Common fields: { event_id, timestamp, recommendation_id, operation_id, actor, status, links: [audit_url, operation_url] }
Delivery: signed HMAC (X-Optimize-Signature), exponential backoff retries (3 attempts with jitter, then dead-letter to internal queue). Webhook payloads include simulation diffs for apply and rollback payloads include reversal diff and affected resource list.
